  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>During the reaction, first addition of water takes place according to Markownikoff's rule, alcohol is formed, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CrO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math> acts as an oxidising agents which converts alcohol into ketone, then Wolf Kishner reduction occurs.</p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0057_5f2ad7ce1c6d.png\" style=\"width: 600px; height: 266px;\"/></p><p>Hence option A is the answer.</p>"
